# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the op-fusion SHIP gates (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of
# tp4/fusion-1 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. Templates only: no tag is pushed from the
# branch by its author. ORDER.txt has the order, the stop rules, the minutes and the pass rule. ONE IMAGE: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-s6nt-1 is a PLACEHOLDER for the tag B0 builds from the approved commit
# (sed -i 's/tp4-s6nt-1/<tag>/' *.env). The cards are under development: nothing here stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# GX0 (STOP): the CONTROL of the exactness pair, on the same image as GX1: the ship candidate profile c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-traffic-s6 over the
# exactness test list (the parked and Lever N equal-answer tests: the same prompts, exact-length completions, content hashes), unaudited. The smoke ends red only by the
# concurrent8_steady list rule (C2_SMOKE_PARTIAL names the omission). Its logs are the reference of GX1. TELEMETRY (C2_TELEMETRY=1, scripts/ci/card_telemetry.py): the
# read-only ARC sidecar samples every chip once a second through the smoke step (AICLK and the limiter holding it, power, current, temperature, kernel NOPs); read
# telemetry-smoke/telemetry-summary.txt beside the result; the first [TELEMETRY] line must say decode check ok. It runs on the host and reads only. CHECKPOINT
# (C2_MODEL_REPO and C2_MODEL_REVISION, qwen_c2_checkpoint.py): the job serves ukisai/Swift-1.5-Qwen3.8-27b at b4c84d42903a, the checkpoint production serves beside this
# profile, from its own converted-weight directory and with its catalog entry's request numbers laid over the profile's (serving_c2_contract.checkpoint_limits: the default
# answer and the output ceiling), as a production boot runs; the keys are the same in G1, GX0, GX1 and G2, so GX0 and GX1 differ by the profile alone. READ: the container
# log holds "[QWEN-C2] checkpoint ukisai/Swift-1.5-Qwen3.8-27b@b4c84d42903a8646b25857eb2827288d92ed85a4 key=..." once, a "weight cache ...: found" line and the worker's
# "[QWEN-C2] checkpoint bound ..." line (the smoke step passes c2_smoke_check.py --expect-checkpoint; the prefix gate checks every arm's log). Duration (estimate): 15
# minutes.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-s6nt-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-traffic-s6
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,parked_equal,parked_budgets,levern_equal,levern_equal_busy
C2_MODEL_REPO=ukisai/Swift-1.5-Qwen3.8-27b
C2_MODEL_REVISION=b4c84d42903a8646b25857eb2827288d92ed85a4
C2_SMOKE_PARTIAL=exactness control arm: its test list is fixed by the protocol, so concurrent8_steady is not run
C2_BOX_MINUTES=40
C2_TELEMETRY=1
